[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-chemistry@b8815c89614198eb49a8db0018dc9635339d0aca/docs/img/hero.jpg[/img][/center]

[center][size=4][b]NPC autonomy for Rapport. Every pair in range is weighed on how well they know each other, whose place it is, who is watching and whether one of them is spoken for, and most of the time the answer is no.[/b][/size][/center]

[center]
